Z||000000||jch82||09-24-2001||03:01 PM||||Here's the story, I'm on my way home from college and stop at a dealer auction. My grandpa and uncle are there bidding on some cars. I park across the street in front of a garage and walk back to where they are at. About 10min later, the auctioneer says over the loud speaker "Somebody needs to move their fiero because it's blocking the road". Then goes on to say, "I know nobody wants to admit it is their's but it needs to be moved..."  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"><P>Now I'm a little angry with that comment and would like to say "That's my fiero!" while flipping him off and smiling  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">, but I refrain and go and move MY FIERO because ignorant people like that mean cheaper parts for me!!<P>Just had to vent before my next class..... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82.jpg"> ||||reg||8
